# Quiz balloon example: record the outcome, then alter the next conversation.

~ start
if GameState.has_completed_quiz("warmup_basics"):
	Quiz Bot: Your best warm-up score is {{GameState.quiz_best_score("warmup_basics")}} out of 1.
	- Try again
		=> question
	- Leave the quiz
		=> END

if GameState.is_quest_active("first_workout"):
	Quiz Bot: Quick check: which choice is a good warm-up?
	=> question

Quiz Bot: Coach Mira will send you here once your first workout has started.
=> END

~ question
Quiz Bot: Before exercising, what should you do?

- Begin with gentle movement that gradually raises your heart rate. [#correct]
	set GameState.record_quiz_result("warmup_basics", 1, 1)
	set GameState.complete_quest("first_workout")
	Quiz Bot: Correct! A gradual warm-up prepares your body for activity.
	=> END

- Skip preparation to save energy.
	set GameState.record_quiz_result("warmup_basics", 0, 1)
	Quiz Bot: Not quite. A short warm-up is a safer start.
	=> END

- Avoid drinking water before moving.
	set GameState.record_quiz_result("warmup_basics", 0, 1)
	Quiz Bot: Not quite. Staying hydrated supports your workout.
	=> END
